/godot/issues/113751#issuecomment-3626970655","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113751","id":3626970655,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YLy4f","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T13:33:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T13:33:00Z","body":"This is a problem in the shutdown sequence. `godot_cleanup_profiler` should be called just before `StringName::cleanup` is called. So this is a platforms issue (no such messages are printed on macOS).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626970655/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626979323","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113751#issuecomment-3626979323","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113751","id":3626979323,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YL0_7","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T13:34:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T13:36:40Z","body":"It happens on Linux as well so it's not Windows exclusive, can't test on macOS, but did you run with `--verbose`?\n\nAlso how would this PR trigger this order of the shutdown to fire? ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626979323/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3627001905","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113751#issuecomment-3627001905","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113751","id":3627001905,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YL6gx","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T13:40:43Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T13:40:54Z","body":"Ohh, sorry, I mistook the PR at the top. I expected from the title it would be related to the profiler. \n\n> It happens on Linux as well so it's not Windows exclusive, can't test on macOS, but did you run with --verbose?\n\nActually, I expected https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106016 to complain with this message at the time, but didn't see it complain. I completely forgot `--verbose` is needed for it to print! 😅\n\nThanks for reporting, I'll look into it!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3627001905/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3627048363","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113751#issuecomment-3627048363","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113751","id":3627048363,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YMF2r","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T13:51:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T13:53:11Z","body":"A quick test shows that this solves the problem:\n```diff\ndiff --git a/core/object/gdtype.cpp b/core/object/gdtype.cpp\nindex 389a110f90..4e2cf7cfc4 100644\n--- a/core/object/gdtype.cpp\n+++ b/core/object/gdtype.cpp\n@@ -32,11 +32,11 @@\n\n GDType::GDType(const GDType *p_super_type, StringName p_name) :\n                super_type(p_super_type), name(std::move(p_name)) {\n-       name_hierarchy.push_back(name);\n+       name_hierarchy.push_back(StringName(String(name), true));\n\n        if (super_type) {\n                for (const StringName &ancestor_name : super_type->name_hierarchy) {\n-                       name_hierarchy.push_back(ancestor_name);\n+                       name_hierarchy.push_back(StringName(String(ancestor_name), true));\n                }\n        }\n }\n```\nBut I'm not sure it's a reasonable fix, but it indicates that the stored copies are persisted and therefore should be static strings to make sure they're safe\n\nThis is since the `GDType` pointer persists, so all the references it has must be persisted","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3627048363/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3714551697","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113751#issuecomment-3714551697","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113751","id":3714551697,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dZ4-R","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T12:37:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T12:37:40Z","body":"This would be important to fix for 4.6 as even if benign, this new spam prevents finding other potential leaked stringnames caused by other engine bugs or user-created leaks.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3714551697/reacti